### Test COMMIT Phase ###
# Prerequisite: Run test_prepare.http tests 1 & 2 first

## 1. Commit DEBIT - Success
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-DEBIT"
}

###

## 2. Commit CREDIT - Success
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-CREDIT"
}

###

## 3. Commit - Idempotent (already committed)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-DEBIT"
}

###

## 4. Commit - Transaction Not Found
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-NONEXISTENT"
}

###

## 5. Check accounts after commit
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

###

## 6. Check transactions after commit
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=COMMITTED

###

## 7. Check specific transaction
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions/TX-TEST-001-DEBIT

###

## 8. Check balance of DEBIT account
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC001/balance

###

## 9. Check balance of CREDIT account
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC002/balance
